    From the node's own read-back of the server's store (each password's `ip`, `raw_ip`, the instance's `raw_iface`), never
    from the roster: the address is the server's to hand out. Fail closed everywhere the panel cannot see — reason
    `not_reported` (no instance or password in the snapshot, or the password deactivated), `not_running`, `not_connected`
    (no address yet), `unenforced` (the reported build is not in KEYLESS_SHARE_BUILDS for that path), `raw_excluded`."""
    kind = "csqtt" if _is_csqtt_target(t) else "wdtt"
